* CF2     2018-02-01 according to NOMALL-1823 for NOM35 by SU
* SU9     2018-03-26             NOM 3.5: remove 'INTERNAL-NODE-ID'
* CF3     2018-09-11 NOMALL-2141 New option ASA formatted reports (Unix)
* CF4     2018-12-19 NOMALL-2077 Use node spool type for identification
* SU10    2020-04-01 NOMALL-2379 recat:VREP---L mod:Unix files A26-> A50
* SU11    2020-11-10 NOMALL-2440 split DDM -> NRM-MF-NODES
